
[TestNoBareLoggerOutsideSuper/invalid-0 - 1]
Diagnostic 1: bareLogger (19:31 - 19:36)
Message: Use 'this.logger' here, not the constructor's 'logger': the one super() built carries this class's bindings, and the parameter does not, so anything handed the parameter logs under whoever constructed this instance.
Help: Pass 'this.logger'. The parameter belongs inside the 'super(...)' call only.
  18 |     super({ logger: logger.child({ name: Service.name }) });
  19 |     this.#inner = new Inner({ logger });
     |                               ~~~~~~
  20 |   }
